tinue-1-hq-centurion-ret-command-rule" name="Blessing of Slaanesh" hidden="false"><description>Models with the Blessing of Slaanesh gain +1 Initiative. This bonus is cumulative with other Initiative modifiers.</description></rule></rules><modifiers><modifier id="live-r2-live-r2-fulgrim-blessing-live-r2-r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-retinue-1-hq-centurion-ret-command-hide" type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions /></modifier></modifiers></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups>
